{"words":["It","was","a","night","of","extraordinary","stillness,","and","Mr.","Utterson","found","himself","unable","to","understand","the","strange","circumstances","that","had","brought","him","to","the","door","of","his","old","friend's","laboratory","once","again.","The","selfsame","feeling","of","dread,","halfremembered","from","his","student","days,","crept","over","him","as","he","reached","for","the","tarnished","knocker","and","let","it","fall."],"paraEnd":[55],"pageStarts":{"0":0}}